          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova aneena na Mose, akĩmwĩa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eĩtu ma Nzeloveati nĩmeũneena w’o: ndũtĩa ũmanenga kĩlungu kya ũtiĩwa katĩ wa ana‐a‐ĩthe ma ĩthe woo; na nue wĩtuma mosa ũtiĩwa wa ĩthe woo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.36.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mot 36.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũkaneene na ana ma Isilaeli, ũkĩmea, Mũndũ akw’a ate na mwana mũndũ mũũme, nĩvo ĩndĩ mũkanenga mwĩĩtu wake ũtiĩwa wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ethĩwa nde na mwĩĩtu, mũkanenge ana‐a‐ĩthe make ũtiĩwa wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ethĩwa nde na ana‐a‐ĩthe, mũkanenge endw’a‐ĩthe ũtiĩwa wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ethĩwa nde na endw’a‐ĩthe, nĩvo ĩndĩ mũkanenga mũndũ wa mbaĩ yake ũla wĩ vakuvĩ nake mũvĩanĩ wake ũtiĩwa wake, nake akawosa wĩthĩwe wake: na ũsu ũkeethĩwa mwamũlo na ũtw’ĩo kwa ana ma Isilaeli, o tondũ Yeova wamwĩaĩe Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
